    stem: "Origin Green is Ireland's pioneering food and drink sustainability programme. On-farm assessments constitute a key component of the programme. The paper prints a diagram with Food Safety at the centre, ringed by Traceability, Animal Welfare, Animal Health, Health & Safety, Socio-economic, Biodiversity, Energy & Emissions and Water. (Adapted from origingreen.ie, 2021)",
